[{"title":"这是一个加密的日记 (示例)","path":"/2026/01/14/secret-demo/","content":" 这是一篇私人日记，请输入密码查看。","tags":["秘密","日记"],"categories":["Life"]},{"title":"Welcome to My Tech Notes","path":"/2026/01/14/tech-intro/","content":"This is a placeholder for future technical notes, papers, and project documentation. What is this?This section is dedicated to: Research papers I’m reading. Course notes from NJU and HKUST. Technical tutorials and dev logs.","categories":["Tech"]},{"title":"Hello World","path":"/2026/01/13/hello-world/","content":"Welcome to Hexo! This is your very first post. Check documentation for more info. If you get any problems when using Hexo, you can find the answer in troubleshooting or you can ask me on GitHub. Quick StartCreate a new post$ hexo new My New Post More info: Writing Run server$ hexo server More info: Server Generate static files$ hexo generate More info: Generating Deploy to remote sites$ hexo deploy More info: Deployment","categories":["Life"]},{"title":"武汉2023","path":"/2023/07/15/wuhan-vlog/","content":" Hey, password is required here.","tags":["武汉","旅行"],"categories":["Life"]},{"title":"About Me","path":"/about/index.html","content":"English | 中文 .lang-btn { border: none; background: none; cursor: pointer; font-size: 1rem; padding: 4px 8px; border-radius: 4px; transition: all 0.2s ease; color: var(--text-p3); } .lang-btn.active { color: var(--text-p1); font-weight: bold; background: var(--card-hover); } .lang-btn:hover { color: var(--text-p1); } /* Hide duplicate TOC entries initially */ ZHU YEHANG 📧 231880098@smail.nju.edu.cn EDUCATIONNanjing University — Sep 2023 – PresentB.Eng. in Intelligent Software Engineering GPA: 4.515.0 Rank: 8153 (Overall), 14153 (Major Courses) The Hong Kong University of Science and Technology — Sep 2025 – Dec 2025UG Exchange Program (Computer Science) Academic achievement: selected to appear on the Dean’s List for the School of Engineering Yangzhou High School of Jiangsu Province — Sep 2020 – Jun 2023National College Entrance Examination (2023, Jiangsu): 669750 CERTIFICATIONS ACHIEVEMENTS CET-4: 684, CET-6: 603 IELTS: 8.0 (Listening 8.5, Speaking 7.5, Reading 8.5, Writing 6.5) — Oct 2023 Outstanding Freshman Award, Nanjing University (2023) People’s Scholarship (CNY 2000, Nov 2024) Yan Baoling Overseas Exchange Scholarship (Excellent Award) (fall 2025) National Scholarship (Fall 2025) WORK EXPERIENCESummer Intern | Shanghai Fanyun Information Technology Co., Ltd. Contributed to the early-stage development of the company’s intelligent QA system. Responsibilities included writing system design documentation, implementing backend logic and API testing based on the Dify platform, and creating front-end prototypes. RESEARCH EXPERIENCESemTabla: A Human-in-the-Loop Framework for Semantic Enrichment and Validation of Data Tables (ACM CHI 2026 accepted with Honourable Mention Award) — May 2025 – Sep 2025 Developed an interactive system integrating hierarchical extraction and critical sampling to address missing business semantics in data tables. Verified that extracted semantics significantly enhance LLMs’ reasoning capabilities through user studies and quantitative experiments. Contribution: 3rd Author. Collaborated on system design, literature review, and user study analysis. Advisors: Ke Xu (徐科), Zhuochen Jin (金卓宸) PROJECTSSparse Density Adaptive Attention for 3D Object Detection | HKUST Course Project (COMP4471) Role: Team Member (1 out of 3) | Project grade: 92 | Course grade: A Objective: Address the critical challenge of point cloud sparsity in LiDAR-based 3D object detection for autonomous driving perception. Implemented a Sparse Density Adaptive Attention (SDAA) module integrated with PointPillars to address point cloud sparsity, achieving +5.28% AP on Pedestrian and +4.14% AP on Cyclist detection. “Shapez-like Factory (C++)” | Course Project, Advanced C++ Programming, NJU Developed a simplified factory simulation game inspired by “Shapez” using QT. GitHub “Tomato Bookstore (Spring Boot + Vue)” | Course Project, Software Engineering Computing, NJU Developed an online e-commerce platform for “Tomato Books” to sell physical books. GitHub “SportRoomOnline (Midway + React)” | Course Project, Web Development, NJU (May 2024 – Jun 2024) A modern sports activity management platform. GitHub Automated Email Management System based on Cradle | National-level Innovation Training Program Project Aims to generalize and integrate various functionalities of an email management system. TECHNICAL SKILLS Programming: Python, C++, Java, JavaScript, SQL Frameworks Libraries: PyTorch, Qt, Spring Boot, Vue.js, React Tools Platforms: Git, Linux, Docker, LaTeX ZHU YEHANG 南京大学 · 软件工程（智能软件）本科 📧 231880098@smail.nju.edu.cn📧 3035745730@qq.com📍 Yangzhou, Jiangsu🐙 github.comlajoyazyh 教育背景南京大学 · 软件工程（智能软件）本科 2023年9月 – 至今 GPA：4.515.0（总排名：8153） 学位课学分绩：4.475.0（学位课排名：14153） 香港科技大学 · 计算机科学交换生 2025年9月 – 2025年12月 学习成绩优异，入选工程学院 Dean’s List 江苏省扬州中学 · 理科 高考（2023，江苏）：669750（语文125，数学128，英语139，物理93，化学96，生物88） 2020年9月 – 2023年6月 荣誉与证书 CET-4：684 · CET-6：603 IELTS：总分 8.0（听 8.5 说 7.5 读 8.5 写 6.5） · 2023年10月 国家奖学金 · 2025年秋季 颜宝铃海外交流奖学金优秀奖 · 2025年秋季 人民奖学金二等奖（2000元）· 2024年11月 南京大学新生学院优秀学生 · 2024年6月 工作与实践经历暑期实习 · 上海泛云科技有限公司 早期智能问答系统研发：撰写系统设计文档；基于 Dify 平台实现后端逻辑与 API 测试；前端原型设计 科研经历SemTabla：面向数据表语义增强与验证的人机协同框架（已被 ACM CHI 2026 录用，并获 Honourable Mention Award） 2025年5月 – 2025年9月 开发了一个集成层次化提取与关键采样技术的交互式系统，解决了数据表缺乏明确业务语义的问题。 通过用户研究与定量实验，验证了提取的语义能显著增强大模型的推理能力。 贡献：第三作者（共六人）。参与系统设计、文献综述及用户研究分析。 指导教师：徐科老师，金卓宸老师 项目经历基于稀疏密度自适应注意力的 3D 目标检测 | HKUST 课程项目 (COMP4471) 核心团队成员（13） | 项目成绩：92，课程成绩：A 针对激光雷达点云数据的稀疏性问题，实现稀疏密度自适应注意力 (SDAA) 模块并集成至 PointPillars，采用双流架构、多分支自适应注意力机制和高效特征传播方法。 在 KITTI 基准测试中，行人检测 AP 提升 5.28%，骑行者检测 AP 提升 4.14%。 “Shapez-like Factory (C++)” | NJU 高级程序设计课程项目 灵感来自“Shapez”的工厂仿真小游戏，包含采矿、传送带、切割器与设备升级等机制。 源码 “Tomato Bookstore (Spring Boot + Vue)” | NJU 软工二课程项目 图书电商平台：用户注册登录、浏览与购买；管理员管理书籍信息、订单与库存。 源码 “SportRoomOnline (Midway + React)” | NJU Web 开发课程项目 现代化体育活动管理平台。 源码 基于 CRADLE 的自动化邮件管理系统 | 国家级大创项目 目标：泛化集成邮件系统功能，利用自反与学习能力提升处理准确率与满意度。 技术技能 编程语言: Python, C++, Java, JavaScript, SQL 框架与库: PyTorch, Qt, Spring Boot, Vue.js, React 工具与平台: Git, Linux, Docker, LaTeX // Define TOC mapping const tocIdsEn = [ 'EDUCATION', 'CERTIFICATIONS-ACHIEVEMENTS', 'WORK-EXPERIENCE', 'RESEARCH-EXPERIENCE', 'PROJECTS', 'TECHNICAL-SKILLS' ]; const tocIdsZh = [ '教育背景', '荣誉与证书', '工作与实践经历', '科研经历', '项目经历', '技术技能' ]; function updateTOC(lang) { // Try to find TOC links. Hexo stellar usually uses .toc-link // We try to match the href attribute const allLinks = document.querySelectorAll('.toc-link'); if (!allLinks.length) return; allLinks.forEach(link => { const href = link.getAttribute('href'); if (!href) return; // Remove # const id = decodeURIComponent(href.substring(1)); // Check if this ID belongs to EN or ZH list // Note: Hexo might add numbers or suffixes, so we check inclusion // A simpler way: Hide based on context if possible, but structure prevents it. // We check if the ID matches our known headers. let isEn = tocIdsEn.some(key => id.includes(key)); let isZh = tocIdsZh.some(key => id.includes(key)); if (lang === 'en') { if (isZh) { link.closest('.toc-item') ? link.closest('.toc-item').style.display = 'none' : link.style.display = 'none'; } else if (isEn) { link.closest('.toc-item') ? link.closest('.toc-item').style.display = 'block' : link.style.display = 'block'; } } else { if (isEn) { link.closest('.toc-item') ? link.closest('.toc-item').style.display = 'none' : link.style.display = 'none'; } else if (isZh) { link.closest('.toc-item') ? link.closest('.toc-item').style.display = 'block' : link.style.display = 'block'; } } }); } function showLang(lang) { const en = document.getElementById('resume-en'); const zh = document.getElementById('resume-zh'); const btnEn = document.getElementById('btn-en'); const btnZh = document.getElementById('btn-zh'); if (lang === 'en') { en.style.display = 'block'; zh.style.display = 'none'; btnEn.classList.add('active'); btnZh.classList.remove('active'); } else { en.style.display = 'none'; zh.style.display = 'block'; btnEn.classList.remove('active'); btnZh.classList.add('active'); } // Update TOC after a short delay to ensure DOM is ready if it's dynamic setTimeout(() => updateTOC(lang), 50); } // Initialize on load document.addEventListener('DOMContentLoaded', () => { showLang('en'); });"},{"title":"友链","path":"/links/index.html","content":"欢迎交换友链！ 如果你想在这里添加你的链接，请在下方留言，格式如下： 名称：你的网站名称 简介：一句话介绍你的网站 链接：你的网站地址 头像：你的 Avatar 链接 我的朋友们(暂无友链，快来成为第一个吧！)"}]